WEBVTT

00:03:29.756 --> 00:03:32.996
And I wanted to figure out
where does someone at a senior level go.

00:03:33.036 --> 00:03:34.916
With help of my now business partner,

00:03:34.956 --> 00:03:38.876
I did 12 dinners across the country
with 20 or 30 women of color each.

00:03:38.876 --> 00:03:42.916
What I heard was story upon story
around micro aggressions, around racism,

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:46.796
around how women navigated spaces
where they felt alone.

00:03:46.836 --> 00:03:49.596
Those conversations became
the basis of the book

00:03:49.636 --> 00:03:51.196
we're going to talk about today.

00:03:51.196 --> 00:03:54.676
It also became the basis of the company
that I founded with my co-founder.

00:03:54.676 --> 00:03:57.156
It’s called nFormation,
and we provide safe, brave

00:03:57.196 --> 00:03:58.796
and new space for women of color.

00:03:58.796 --> 00:04:01.196
I also just want to end
with maybe three concepts